## MCP - Games Analysis

**Endpoint:** POST /webhook/games-analysis

### Input
```json
{
  "tenant_id": "chess_plugin",
  "user_id": "discord_123456",
  "game_id": "665f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d",
  "analysis": {
    "done": true,
    "accuracy": {
      "white": 85.5,
      "black": 72.3
    },
    "mistakes": {
      "blunders": 2,
      "mistakes": 3,
      "inaccuracies": 5
    },
    "key_moments": [
      {
        "move_number": 15,
        "description": "Blunder",
        "evaluation_before": 1.5,
        "evaluation_after": -3.2
      }
    ],
    "summary": "Bonne ouverture..."
  }
}
```

### Output
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Analyse mise a jour",
  "game_id": "665f1a2b..."
}
```

### Erreurs
- 404: game_id introuvable

### RFC-039 compliant
